## Getting Started

### For Implementers

1. **Read First**:
   - This README (Executive Summary above) — high-level understanding
   - [{{featureName}}.spec.md](./{{featureName}}.spec.md) — algorithm and architecture

2. **During Implementation**:
   - [{{featureName}}.plan.md](./{{featureName}}.plan.md) — follow phase-by-phase guide and update todo statuses as you progress

3. **When Stuck**:
   - Search {{featureName}}.spec.md for specific topics
   - Review algorithm and edge cases sections
   - Look at code examples

### For Reviewers

1. **Architecture Review**:
   - Read the Executive Summary above
   - Review algorithm in {{featureName}}.spec.md
   - Check security considerations

2. **Code Review**:
   - Use {{featureName}}.plan.md todo statuses and sign-off section to verify completeness
   - Reference {{featureName}}.spec.md for requirements
   - Validate test coverage

3. **Documentation Review**:
   - Check all docs listed in {{featureName}}.plan.md
   - Verify examples work

